    {
      "id": "43376f60-64b5-4159-bc75-0ccc78ae5540",
      "regionName": "content",
      "type": "region",
      "components": [
        {
          "componentAttributes": {
            "richTextValue": "<section class=\"lsbc-section\"><p>Most applications can be completed online on this portal. The Board's paper forms and reference documents are below.</p><ul class=\"lsbc-doclist\"><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cosmetology Laws and Rules</a><span> The Board's statute and rules book.</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">License Renewal Form</a><span> Renew a license or permit, or request a duplicate. You can also do this online.</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reciprocity Applications</a><span> Cosmetology, esthetician, manicurist and instructor packets, with the state-by-state requirements.</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reciprocity - Military</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Foreign Reciprocity Application</a><span> With the approved credential evaluation agencies.</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Temporary Permit Application</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Threading Application</a><span> With the Facial Threading Study Guide.</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Request for Certification of Louisiana Licensure (Affidavit)</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shop Application</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Threading and Alternative Hair Design Facility Application</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Requirements for Opening a New School</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">School Forms</a><span> Enrollment, hours, termination, exam and accommodation forms for schools.</span></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Florida Transfer Requirements</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.lsbc.louisiana.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booth Renters Information</a><span> Guidance on independent contractor status.</span></li></ul><p>Approved continuing education providers are listed on the <a href=\"/LPI/s/ce-providers\">CE Providers</a> page.</p></section>"
          },
